; @cheezmil is published to registry.npmjs.org (owner scope). The default pnpm
; registry (npmmirror) lags on fresh publishes, so pin this scope to upstream.
@cheezmil:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/

; NOTE: pnpm 12's pre-script install verification (verifyDepsBeforeRun, default
; "install") fails here because the lockfile pins local workspace versions
; (@cheezmil/aek-home@0.0.4 / @cheezmil/aek-websearch@1.1.15, ahead of npm) and
; warns on every `pnpm run` (scripts still rc=0). pnpm 12 ignores the .npmrc key
; (kebab AND camelCase both dropped), so the fix lives in ~/.zshrc as the env var
; `PNPM_CONFIG_VERIFY_DEPS_BEFORE_RUN=false`. Do NOT re-add a .npmrc key here —
; it is silently ignored.
